          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Control how and when your pallets are picked up. </p><p><em>Earn Partner Perks Reward Points when we receive your shipment.</em></p><p><strong>Some Freight Shipping Options:</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.xpo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.xpo.com/\"><strong>XPO.com</strong></a> - <em>DIY online</em></p><ul><li>provides quote & online payment with XPO Freight</li><li>receive all tracing and information directly</li><li>XPO Customer Care Team: 1-800-755-2728</li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.freightquote.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.freightquote.com/\"><strong>FreightQuote.com</strong></a> - <em>DIY online</em></p><ul><li>instant quote & online payment</li><li>provides multiple carriers to choose from</li><li>receive all tracing and information directly</li></ul>",
